A C++ project generated with [Devora](https://github.com/Nathandona/Devora).

## Requirements

- A C++{{ cpp_standard }} compiler (GCC, Clang, or MSVC)
- CMake 3.20 or newer

## Build

```bash
cmake -B build
cmake --build build
```

The executable is written to `build/` (for example `build/{{ project_slug }}`,
or `build/Debug/{{ project_slug }}.exe` on multi-config generators).

## Run

```bash
./build/{{ project_slug }}
```
{% if include_tests %}
## Test

Tests use [doctest](https://github.com/doctest/doctest), vendored as a single
header under `tests/`, so the suite builds offline.

```bash
cmake -B build
cmake --build build
ctest --test-dir build
```
{% endif %}
